# Local-only research memory (disclosure decision 2026-07-13)
# Glob, not the exact name: an exact `CLAUDE.local.md` pattern leaves renames
# and .bak siblings untracked-but-visible to git.
CLAUDE.local*
Codex.local*
docs/spec/
AGENTS_STATE.json

# Local analysis-unit handoff (kept at repository root by workflow contract)
/INSTRUCTIONS_FOR_*.md
/REPORT_*.md
/REQUEST_*.md
/scratchpad/

# Local probe/measurement working area (per-report artifact sets; regenerable
# from the docx corpus + Word, so never tracked and safe to prune)
/tmp/

# Renderer scratch output dropped at the repository root. The renderer writes
# <prefix>_p<N>.png, so an ad-hoc `... x 96` run leaves x_p1.png.. behind;
# compare_*.png / oxi_*.png / test_*.pdf etc. are covered further up.
/x_p*.png
/p_p*.png
*.tmp
